    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "d64bced2-ebf0-4fbb-ab48-7c6ef2c8308f",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E4* Naples hotel\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursions \u0026amp; guided tours included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWelcome dinner\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EProfessional tour manager\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flights to Italy\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EReturn hydrofoil to Ischia\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach in Italy\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOne free place per 10 paying passengers\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "What\u0027s included in this tour is entirely yours to customise to suit your group\u0027s budget and preferences. Here is what we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "94cfad95-4b6e-46be-b898-d62f3092cb82",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EFour nights at the centrally located 4* Hotel Palazzo Alabardieri in Naples. Located just a short distance from the Piazza del Plebiscito, facilities at the hotel include a restaurant and a bar and all rooms are en suite. Dinner is included the first night and the remaining four nights are on bed and breakfast basis.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Where you stay is entirely yours to choose to match your group\u0027s preferences. Here is our suggested accommodation:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "29cb8a85-ec89-4437-b490-c476df455343",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENaples - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPalazzo Reale\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETeatrino di Corte\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMuseo Nazionale Archeologico - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHerculaneum - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOplontis - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPio Monte della Misericordia\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGallery of Palazzo Zevallos Stigliano\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDuomo of San Gennaro\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECappella Sansevero\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The places your group visits are exclusively yours to decide. Here are the main sights we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "ea6976f0-f4e2-4587-b73a-34dc33894c35",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIsland of Ischia - guided tour takes in the old town and Giardini la Mortella, the spectacular subtropical and Mediterranean garden developed since 1956 by the late Susana Walton, wife of the composer Sir William Walton\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMuseo di Capodimonte - housed in a palazzo built in 1738 by the Bourbon King Charles III and home to a magnificent collection of Italian paintings with works by Titian, Botticelli, Perugino, Raphael and Sebastiano del Piombo\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECatacomba di San Gennaro - became a Christian pilgrimage site when San Gennaro\u0026#39;s body was interred here in the 5th century and its treasures include 2nd century Christian frescoes and 5th century mosaics\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECertosa e Museo di San Martino - founded as a Carthusian monastery in the 14th century, this charterhouse has been decorated, adorned and altered over the centuries by the likes of Giovanni Antonio Dosio in the 16th century and Baroque master Cosimo Fanzago a century later\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EUnderground Greek-Roman remains at San Lorenzo Maggiore - remains of the Greek meeting place and marketplace, known as the Agora, and a Roman food market or \u2018Macellum\u2019\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "\nIf you\u0027d prefer to visit different places, or if you\u0027d like to add extra attractions that match your group\u0027s specific interests, here are some more suggestions:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "1af6d70e-9b0f-434a-9517-004324749dd0",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 - Naples\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flight to Italy from your preferred airport \u2013 transfer with our tour manager in our private executive coach to the centrally located 4* Hotel Palazzo Alabardieri in Naples \u2013 dinner in the hotel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Guided tour of Naples, Palazzo Reale, Teatrino di Corte \u0026amp; Museo Nazionale Archeologico\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA morning day guided tour of Naples \u2013 begun by Domenico Fontana for the Spanish Viceroys in 1600, a guided tour of the Palazzo Reale reveals great halls filled with furniture, tapestries, paintings and porcelain \u2013 Teatrino di Corte was designed by Ferdinando Fuga to celebrate the marriage of Maria Carolina of Hapsburg to Ferdinand IV in 1768 \u2013 widely acknowledged as one of the world\u2019s most important archaeological museums, a guided tour of the Museo Nazionale Archeologico explores not only many wonderful artefacts from Pompeii and Herculaneum, but also the fabulous Farnese collections containing classical sculpture which Charles of Bourbon inherited from his mother Elizabeth.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Herculaneum \u0026amp; Oplontis\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDestroyed with Pompeii in the eruption of Vesuvius, a guided tour of Herculaneum explores the remains of a town built for the enjoyment of sea breezes and views across the Bay of Naples that was home to an array of sprawling villas owned by wealthy patricians \u2013 continue to Oplontis, also destroyed in the eruption of Vesuvius, for a guided tour of the excellently preserved architecture and decorations at Villa Poppaea, the home of Nero\u2019s wife and his family.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013 Pio Monte della Misericordia, Gallery of Palazzo Zevallos Stigliano, Duomo of San Gennaro \u0026amp; Cappella Sansevero\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA full day in Naples begins at the 17th century octagonal church of Pio Monte della Misericordia which is home to Caravaggio\u2019s impressive \u2018Seven Acts of Mercy\u2019 \u2013 continue to the Gallery of Palazzo Zevallos Stigliano to see Caravaggio\u2019s \u2018The Martyrdom of Saint Ursula\u2019, thought to be his last painting \u2013 visit the Duomo of San Gennaro, built between 1294 and 1323 \u2013 sculptures in the Baroque Cappella Sansevero include Giuseppe Sanmartino\u0026#39;s \u2018Cristo velato\u2019 (Veiled Christ), Francesco Queirolo\u0026#39;s \u2018Disinganno\u2019 (Disillusion) and Antonio Corradini\u0026#39;s \u2018Pudicizia\u2019 (Modesty).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 Naples\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMorning free at leisure before our transfer to your preferred airport for our scheduled flight home.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Your itinerary is exclusively yours to tailor to suit your group\u0027s interests and profile of your members. Here is our suggested itinerary:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember, every element of this itinerary can be adjusted. If you\u0027d like to change the days, add different activities, or adjust the pace, just let us know."
          }
        }
      ]
